cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use this app, please cite the work it implements (preferred-citation), this release, and Pennsieve (RRID:SCR_021677); the other works it builds on are listed under references.
type: software
title: SynthStrip Skull Stripping
abstract: Skull-strips T1-weighted brain MRI with SynthStrip (FreeSurfer), a learning-based tool that
  works on images of any contrast and resolution. Writes the brain-extracted image and binary brain mask
  per subject.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-synthstrip
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- neuroimaging
- mri
- nifti
- synthstrip
- freesurfer
- skull-stripping
# The work this app implements; the release report's "How to cite" puts it first.
